        "dialogs": {
          "722250201": {
            "id": "722250201",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Please help us with the Perch!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250202"
            ]
          },
          "722250202": {
            "id": "722250202",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I'll stay here with Big Brother Ku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7222503",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722250301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722250301": {
            "id": "722250301",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Ooh, the Perch is all lit up now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250302"
            ]
          },
          "722250302": {
            "id": "722250302",
            "speakerId": 20449,
            "speakerName": "Ku",
            "text": "Guess that's that done. Sorry, I imagine that it was pretty rough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250303"
            ]
          },
          "722250303": {
            "id": "722250303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe! We're specialist problem solvers, don'cha know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250304"
            ]
          },
          "722250304": {
            "id": "722250304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's not that different from the Light Actuating Ceremony.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250305"
            ]
          },
          "722250305": {
            "id": "722250305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Going to three spots to fix three smaller problems to solve a larger issue...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250306"
            ]
          },
          "722250306": {
            "id": "722250306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It feels like we've had this happen to us a lot, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250307"
            ]
          },
          "722250307": {
            "id": "722250307",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I don't really understand a lot of what you said, but the adults do have this saying...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250308"
            ]
          },
          "722250308": {
            "id": "722250308",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "They call it \"The Rule of Three.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250309"
            ]
          },
          "722250309": {
            "id": "722250309",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's that supposed to mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250310"
            ]
          },
          "722250310": {
            "id": "722250310",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Well, I guess they just mean that you need to do things thrice in order to get a result.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250311"
            ]
          },
          "722250311": {
            "id": "722250311",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "For example, they say that \"good omens must occur three times for good fortune to truly descend\"... Same for bad omens.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250312"
            ]
          },
          "722250312": {
            "id": "722250312",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "They also say that \"you must forge past obstacles three times to succeed on the fourth.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250313"
            ]
          },
          "722250313": {
            "id": "722250313",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But isn't that more like the \"Rule of Four,\" then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250314"
            ]
          },
          "722250314": {
            "id": "722250314",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Huh, that's true! You're really good at numbers, Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250315"
            ]
          },
          "722250315": {
            "id": "722250315",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, of course!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250317"
            ]
          },
          "722250317": {
            "id": "722250317",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Anyway, are you sure Ku will be fine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250319"
            ]
          },
          "722250319": {
            "id": "722250319",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Don't worry, he's always like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250320"
            ]
          },
          "722250320": {
            "id": "722250320",
            "speakerId": 20449,
            "speakerName": "Ku",
            "text": "Ugh, what an embarrassment... I just hope this won't affect the ceremony.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250321"
            ]
          },
          "722250321": {
            "id": "722250321",
            "speakerId": 20449,
            "speakerName": "Ku",
            "text": "I wouldn't know how to face you if it does, Ruu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250322"
            ]
          },
          "722250322": {
            "id": "722250322",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Oh, don't be like that! You've always been so nice to me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250323"
            ]
          },
          "722250323": {
            "id": "722250323",
            "speakerId": 20449,
            "speakerName": "Ku",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250324"
            ]
          },
          "722250324": {
            "id": "722250324",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, Paimon, you two go ahead first!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722250325"
            ]
          },
          "722250325": {
            "id": "722250325",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I'll stay here with Big Brother Ku. We'll take charge of the cleanup work once you're done with the offering!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
